		{"id":"1f2ea567824fd524","type":"text","text":"动脑","x":-200,"y":-160,"width":82,"height":50},
		{"id":"5ccfb87e2f61feed","type":"text","text":"不动脑","x":-200,"y":40,"width":118,"height":50},
		{"id":"8522286a998d8766","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260914105026.png","x":520,"y":40,"width":400,"height":57},
		{"id":"625fe1fd20398931","type":"text","text":"动脑","x":-380,"y":-80,"width":80,"height":60},
		{"id":"ef8d32b22cdb75aa","type":"text","text":"动脑必然会得出结论，省略了很多东西，动脑就得取舍、做出判断，比如一条路100个台阶，正常人走一步一个，但是你经过大脑判断自己一步可以走十个台阶，那么这不就是省略步骤，这不就是不真诚吗","x":-159,"y":-733,"width":320,"height":213},
		{"id":"e0f6e48a48584e1d","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260914113356.png","x":-69,"y":-302,"width":400,"height":31},
		{"id":"7b819494a487b989","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260914113452.png","x":221,"y":-701,"width":123,"height":50},
		{"id":"cb9940de190a4ba9","type":"text","text":"耍滑、不实诚，耍小聪明","x":161,"y":-160,"width":239,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"9952ba3a12ce5fa2","type":"text","text":"真实","x":180,"y":40,"width":81,"height":50},
		{"id":"eb30d08bfb1314eb","type":"text","text":"保守、基础上优化","x":-1930,"y":1873,"width":234,"height":60},
		{"id":"616b48470ea45196","type":"text","text":"面对不同的人","x":-1840,"y":2033,"width":160,"height":50},
		{"id":"6c5a08c114c6e2f4","type":"text","text":"改掉的叫缺点、改不掉的叫弱点","x":-1540,"y":1870,"width":300,"height":63},
		{"id":"64cd319a63c7bbe6","type":"text","text":"不是改变、而是优化，调整","x":-1449,"y":1766,"width":249,"height":54},
		{"id":"c240eb30a52d48f0","type":"text","text":"讨论个问题，改变 和 优化调整 那个更适合现在的自己，我接受不了改变，我认为改变这个词是贬义词，是对自己的否定，我会陷入自卑恐惧中，而优化调整是我能接受的","x":-1080,"y":1765,"width":677,"height":55},
		{"id":"df72a1629c5ffd1b","type":"text","text":"选择","x":150,"y":-424,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d9b446ac585dfe50","type":"text","text":"实事求是","x":-18,"y":40,"width":116,"height":50},
